{"id":"n91148-1-7","stage":4,"title":"터 · 基","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91148-1-7-1","ko":"여기에 새로 건물이 들어서나 봐요?","zh":"这里好像要新建一栋楼吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건물이","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어서나","meaning":"出现，建造","explanation":"들어서다：出现，建造；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"들어서다","audio":"/audio/cd557fcd2d341085e663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58158","senseId":"3","lemma":"들어서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐요?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"51a9489f74ea88e7","term":"건물","zh":"建筑，建筑物","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3","entryId":"28029","definition":"为住人、做事或保管东西而建造的有墙壁和屋顶的构造物。","pronunciation":["건ː물"]},{"id":"cd557fcd2d341085","term":"들어서다","zh":"出现，建造","audio":"/audio/cd557fcd2d341085e663.mp3","entryId":"58158","definition":"建筑物建立在某个地方。","pronunciation":["드러서다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/18fb1d60c0052d978954.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91148-1-7-2","ko":"터를 다지고 있는 걸 보니 그런 것 같아.","zh":"看他们正在打地基，应该是那样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"터를","meaning":"基，址","explanation":"터：基，址；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"터","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91148","senseId":"1","lemma":"터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다지고","meaning":"压实，打夯","explanation":"다지다：压实，打夯；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"다지다","audio":"/audio/3e49224795eea6ede5ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28354","senseId":"1","lemma":"다지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니","meaning":"推测","explanation":"보다：推测；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"20","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cfabc7b0ff6f800c","term":"터","zh":"基，址","audio":"/audio/cfabc7b0ff6f800c4a76.mp3","entryId":"91148","definition":"用于计划或已经建造建筑的场地。","pronunciation":["터"]},{"id":"3e49224795eea6ed","term":"다지다","zh":"压实，打夯","audio":"/audio/3e49224795eea6ede5ef.mp3","entryId":"28354","definition":"按压、踩或拍打翘起来的东西，使其牢固。","pronunciation":["다지다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"推测","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"根据某事判断。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a7782f2c6a9286a605cd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.373,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91148","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.7974,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["看他们正在打地基，应该是那样。","你怎么连这么简单的事情都做不好？","这里好像要新建一栋楼吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["看他们正在打地基，应该是那样。","这里好像要新建一栋楼吧？","你怎么连这么简单的事情都做不好？"],"answer":0}]}
